Meta:
	Version	1
	
	Lang	ja
	Title	前途多難
	Desc	ゲージ上昇UP <#c:00f>(290%)
	Desc	ゲージ4本目以上の時
	Desc	MISS判定時にゲージが0になる
	
	Lang	en
	Title	Grim Prospect
	Desc	Increments the gauge increase rate to
	Desc	<#c:00f>290%<#r>.
	Desc	The gauge become 0 when MISS until you
	Desc	get 4 gauge blocks.
	
	Attr	BManiac
	Indicator	IDBoost	INBoost

OnJudge:
	If	Answer	!=	M
		Boost	INBoost	Mul	2.9
	ClearIf

	If	Gauge	>=	4
	If	Answer	=	M
		Boost	IDBoost	Add	-500000
	ClearIf
